nvironmental services market in which we operate generates approximately $163 billion of annual revenue, which includes the $110 billion recycling and waste industry, $37 billion of the broader environmental solutions industry, and $16 billion in sustainability innovation (described below) and emerging waste and recycling technologies. Within our recycling and waste business, we prioritize investments in market verticals with above-average growth rates and higher return profiles. The environmental solutions market remains fragmented, which provides consolidation opportunities to drive scale. In our sustainability innovation businesses, we believe customer demand for products and services that respond to evolving environmental trends, including circularity and decarbonization, should support above average growth rates and attracti","zh":null},{"en":"We operate throughout the United States and Canada, but the physical collection and recycling or disposal of material is largely a local business, and the dynamics and opportunities differ in each market we serve. By combining local operating management with standardized business practices, we drive greater overall operating efficiency across the Company while maintaining day-to-day operating decisions at the local level, closest to the customer.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Expansion of Recycling Capabilities - Based on the most recent United States Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) data, approximately 32% of municipal solid waste is recycled and/or composted. We expect that percentage to increase over the long-term as communities enhance and expand their recycling programs for their residents. As a key player in the circular economy, we are strategically focused on expanding recycling volume through innovative material handling processes and programs to help our customers achieve their goals related to sustainability and environmentally sound practices while also generating an appropriate return. In 2024, we commenced operations at our first Polymer Center in Las Vegas, Nevada. In 2025, we commenced operations at our second Polymer Center in Indianapolis, Indiana and construction began at our third Polymer Center in Allentown, Pennsylvania. Our Polymer","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a competitive industry. Competition in the environmental services industry comes from a few other large, national publicly-owned companies, several regional publicly- and privately-owned companies and thousands of small privately-owned companies. In any given market, competitors may have larger operations and greater resources. In addition, we","zh":null},{"en":"compete with municipalities that maintain material collection or disposal operations. These municipalities may have financial advantages due to the availability of tax revenue and greater opportunities for tax-exempt financing.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Recycling & Solid Waste Segments","val":16874000000,"zh":"Recycling & Solid Waste Segments"},{"name":"Group1Segment","val":8630000000,"zh":"Group1Segment"},{"name":"Group2Segment","val":8244000000,"zh":"Group2Segment"},{"name":"Group3Segment","val":1784000000,"zh":"Group3Segment"}],"total":19027000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Collection Service Line","val":11233000000,"zh":"Collection Service Line"},{"name":"Collection Service Line Smallcontainer","val":5055000000,"zh":"Collection Service Line Smallcontainer"},{"name":"Landfill Service Line","val":3202000000,"zh":"Landfill Service Line"},{"name":"Collection Service Line Largecontainer","val":3098000000,"zh":"Collection Service Line Largecontainer"},{"name":"Collection Service Line Residential","val":3010000000,"zh":"Collection Service Line Residential"},{"name":"Transfer Service Line","val":1833000000,"zh":"Transfer Service Line"},{"name":"Environmental Solutions Service Line","val":1828000000,"zh":"Environmental Solutions Service Line"},{"name":"Other Service Line","val":824000000,"zh":"Other Service Line"},{"name":"Other Service Line Sale Of Recycled Commodities","val":433000000,"zh":"Other Service Line Sale Of Recycled Commodities"},{"name":"Other Service Line Other Noncore","val":391000000,"zh":"Other Service Line Other Noncore"}],"total":19027000000}},"peers":["WCN","ROP","PH","RHI","WM"]}}